[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891550\">2125C24</a></p><p>1. Remove the fan control knob.</p><p>2. Undo the bolt.</p><p>3. Release the retainers (3a) and move the cowling (3b) slightly.</p><p>4. Disconnect the electrical connections (4a, 4b, 4c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4a</p></td><td><p>Switch control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890442\">H90A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4b</p></td><td><p>Switch control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890447\">H90B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4c</p></td><td><p>Climate control system controls</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890427\">H80</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035883.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the embellishment\nis not damaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections.</p><p>Position the embellishment and engage the\nretainers.</p><p>Tighten the bolt.</p><p>Fit the fan control knob.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891550\">2125C24</a></p><p>Check that the switches on the embellishment\nare working.</p>"]]